  sentences:
    nameNPC: "T\u01B0\u1EDBng Tr\u1EA7n"
    Lines:
    - "Ti\u1EBFng d\xE2y cung gi\u1EADt. H\xE0ng tr\u0103m m\u0169i t\xEAn l\u1EEDa
      bay v\xE8o v\xE8o v\u1EC1 ph\xEDa b\u1EDD nam, nh\u01B0 v\u0169 tr\u1EE5 sao
      b\u0103ng \u0111\u1ECF r\u1EF1c trong \u0111\xEAm."
    - "M\u0169i t\xEAn l\u1EEDa r\u01A1i xu\u1ED1ng b\u1EDD, \u0111\xE2m v\xE0o l\u1EC1u
      tr\u1EA1i, v\xE0o c\xE2y c\u1ECF. L\u1EEDa b\xF9ng l\xEAn t\u1EEBng \u0111\xE1m."
